1
00:00:11,200 --> 00:00:12,480
How good!  Thank you very much.

2
00:00:13,160 --> 00:00:14,680
My name is Xavier Guix.

3
00:00:15,200 --> 00:00:19,680
I am a psychologist, a writer,
I have written a few books.  I will

4
