have left peacefully

286
00:14:20,400 --> 00:14:22,240
and you've got all the work

287
00:14:22,920 --> 00:14:24,800
just because you don't know how to say no.

288
00:14:24,880 --> 00:14:27,960
Enough, please, nothing will happen.

289
00:14:28,040 --> 00:14:30,840
Tell your boss:
'I won't do it this time.'"

290
00:14:32,160 --> 00:14:32,960
Answer:

291
00:14:33,680 --> 00:14:34,880
"Impossible.

292
00:14:36,040 --> 00:14:38,600
Just thinking about it makes me anxious."

293
00:14:42,720 --> 00:14:44,040
Just thinking about it.

294
00:14:44,120 --> 00:14:47,360
And that is the impossibility
of stopping being good.  That

295
00:14:48,400 --> 00:14:51,200
is, I can't stop obeying,

296
00:14:51,280 --> 00:14:53,240
I have to do what is expected of me,

297
00:14:53,320 --> 00:14:57,120
I have to do things well, I have to
be very punctual, I

298
00:14:57,200 --> 00:14:59,160
have to do it the way they expect it to be done

299
00:14:59,240 --> 00:15:01,120
and, if not, I'm already suffering.

300
00:15:01,640 --> 00:15:03,920
This takes us
into the realm of limits,

301
00:15:04,440 --> 00:15:07,920
and the realm of limits
is a very good terrain to explore.  We

302
00:15:08,880 --> 00:15:11,960
