the media they find,

448
00:22:39,480 --> 00:22:42,720
culture, school,
peers, etc.

449
00:22:42,800 --> 00:22:46,200
If you just did that, it would be fine,

450
00:22:46,280 --> 00:22:52,200
because, unfortunately, parents
think a lot about molding, they

451
00:22:52,280 --> 00:22:57,160
