fewer and fewer people who want to have children,

479
00:24:17,000 --> 00:24:21,800
because it really is a vocation,

480
00:24:22,880 --> 00:24:23,920
a dedication.

481
00:24:24,400 --> 00:24:27,800
But it is a commitment that,
at the same time, makes you grow a lot.

482
00:24:27,880 --> 00:24:32,880
Children, sons, are a great mirror
for your own life.

483
00:24:32,960 --> 00:24:36,240
Therefore, we want to educate them

484
00:24:36,320 --> 00:24:39,360
and, deep down,
they end up educating us.

485
00:24:47,000 --> 00:24:49,240
Hello, Xavier, how are you?
I am Maria.

486
00:24:49,320 --> 00:24:53,000
I've realized
that being good doesn't always end up being useful.

487
00:24:53,080 --> 00:24:55,200
Can evil goodness exist?

488
00:24:55,720 --> 00:24:56,880
Of course.

489
00:24:57,640 --> 00:25:03,640
In fact, my colleague
and beloved teacher Antoni Bolinches

490
