00:25:42,160 --> 00:25:44,160
Not in benefit, I
don't want to speak in benefit,

503
00:25:44,240 --> 00:25:46,720
but, for me, it's a detriment.  I end up

504
00:25:47,880 --> 00:25:50,960
feeling bad, they
make fun of me, I

